{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d65c80bc2c2523429f9633f3438b7310a468c0324a00be0f855d89e0d2e86889", "ja": "『Cleasky』と『レイジー・レイジー』の\nコラボが動き出した。経過は順調で、衣装合\nわせと合同レッスンのため、志希とフレデリ\nカを劇場に招待する事に。ふたりは劇場を満\n喫するのだった。", "zh": "“Cleasky”与“Lazy·Lazy”的\n合作已经启动。进展十分顺利，为了进行试\n装与联合练习，志希和芙蕾德莉卡\n受邀来到剧场。两人尽情享受了剧场的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bfa70b0d7a66d0a4f938fcfc1ad9c2d2837b76554c77aaf63ca1bc85d149714b", "ja": "（『レイジー・レイジー』とのコラボを打診した\nところ、先方の事務所も乗り気になってくれた！）", "zh": "（向『Lazy Lazy』提出合作邀请后，对方事务所也很积极！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ec825a4762744ec88d07f2ce2d252d55bcf366919845e8f5b9e7a0af6438f89f", "ja": "（こちらのメンツは、『Cleasky』のふたり。\n企画は順調で、今日は合同レッスンと衣装合わせだ）", "zh": "（我们这边的成员，是『Cleasky』的两个人。企划进展顺利，今天要进行联合练习和服装试穿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "c2f1f3589a4bfb287c40524395822d89889c2048e8e90d23e0351d3e60633736", "ja": "見て見て{$P$}！　ワタシたち、\n『レイジー・レイジー』になっちゃったヨ！　えへへ♪", "zh": "你看你看，{$P$}！我们变成『Lazy Lazy』啦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "f588e022a00e261a5a3ee663a1bd8a33dc2012d3eea949f3c8d607931f3ea279", "ja": "むふふ～♪　志希さん、フレデリカさん、\nおそろいですな～。", "zh": "呵呵呵～♪　志希小姐、芙蕾德莉卡小姐，\n我们穿的是同款呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1004_204xxx", "source_sha256": "8c61c7bd98799347d3667d7a09b6a84ba88c834b44fc06b53a89f0a14a652cee", "ja": "そろいもそろってそろいまくりだね☆\n『Cleasky』ちゃんとコラボなんてビックリだよ！", "zh": "真是整整齐齐、配得不能再配了呢☆居然能和『Cleasky』合作，真让人吃惊呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1005_205xxx", "source_sha256": "e6a7c7d80b0e21a904631b07ac79a8d93e60cbf09376ca258daa582684acfab5", "ja": "あたしとフレちゃんをご指名！\n見る目あるね～キミ♪", "zh": "点名要我和芙蕾出场！\n你真有眼光呀～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1006_204xxx", "source_sha256": "1adabd7a80735a96d3444f85aaa8c5a2f01d815906f7ba6221f2e046ff16e84d", "ja": "うんうん、お目が高いねー。おいくらかな？\nキャッシュレスOK？", "zh": "嗯嗯，很有眼光呢～。多少钱呀？\n可以无现金支付吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a5a739dd83dd5ae9ea04bef00706e6c4930ddfa5755609b55b054fab3bc49596", "ja": "いや、売ってるわけではなく。……とにかく、\n一ノ瀬さん、宮本さん、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "不，并不是在卖这个。……总之，\n一之濑小姐、宫本小姐，请多关照了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1008_205xxx", "source_sha256": "829d733e16e2be515a89ef9c299e27a0e169fcee1c7855590d32fadef57ffd97", "ja": "ん～、そこは呼び捨てでいいよ。\nあたし達だけ区別されてるみたいで、なんかヤだし～。", "zh": "嗯～，直接叫名字就行啦。\n感觉好像只有我们被区别对待，总觉得有点讨厌～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1009_204xxx", "source_sha256": "c7c766cc837e33896dfc153097fa7af4f7eb71e93439eae2de67ff8c553928b8", "ja": "そそ、劇場のみんなと同じでいいよ～。\nその方がアタシ達も仲良くなれそう！", "zh": "对对，和剧场里的大家一样就好啦～  \n这样我们也能变得更要好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c5c321aa2c7f56db65cea4bcc5a06a536f1f6387e4a556a980adca92ca068e7f", "ja": "え、そう？　じゃあ、ええと……。\n志希、フレデリカ。よろしく！", "zh": "咦，是吗？那就，呃……\n志希、芙蕾德莉卡，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ac9eae3b44bc8845c3246e7adcbeb4d94ca0a766b615de2d866547f1b21f7b08", "ja": "……っていう感じで、どうですか？", "zh": "……这样感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1012_204xxx", "source_sha256": "f641c161904cb1fff991c4cecc51e330759c32c34bd76654165be779f268a6af", "ja": "うんうんバッチリ、それでいこー！\nミヤちゃんとエレナちゃんもよろしくね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，完美，就这么办吧——！\n米娅和艾蕾娜也拜托啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1013_null", "source_sha256": "36be0285cfb59f820089103968805b2b6da4c7c02c24e9fcdbffa17c9c170ab1", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ！", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6b3e7cfd6389eafceef4e6a020ae1bb8f8544929bcdb1f23e04d340e68632ba9", "ja": "っと……ゴメン、俺のケータイだ。ちょっと失礼……。\nもしもし、はい、お世話になっております……！", "zh": "呃……抱歉，是我的手机。失陪一下……  \n喂，您好，是的，承蒙关照……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c7f9d991c2b5776305029498847378d3bbd91c11cf36dbfe90c4b147d2ca7670", "ja": "はい、ええ、今ちょうど……はい。", "zh": "好的，是的，正好现在……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1016_205xxx", "source_sha256": "893d51d7ae4c79ff121349b70ea19fc3b517c4b66da8597a7ace5de8812576d2", "ja": "ねえねえ美也ちゃん、エレナちゃん。\n今のうちに、抜け出しちゃわない？", "zh": "喂喂，美也、艾蕾娜。  \n要不要趁现在偷偷溜出去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1017_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4e597e31c6b8b66dd1d30a952ff7cee2f7d79d16767ebcc4db49423557b446a1", "ja": "あたし、この劇場にキョーミあるんだ。\n色々見て回りたいから、案内して？", "zh": "我对这个剧场很感兴趣。\n因为想四处参观一下，可以带我逛逛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "98c4048157356408ac22541d28bffa4840fe1dbd8137fdf4dff760437a2b6ab9", "ja": "えっ？　でも、{$P$}さんを\n待っていた方がいいのでは～？", "zh": "诶？可是，不是应该先等{$P$}先生吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1019_204xxx", "source_sha256": "64de09c7d941ea94652c77671b41463175f43669f4faf68b250ada683d8fa611", "ja": "一緒に冒険すると、親愛度も上がるかも！\nコラボなんだし、そういうのも必要じゃないかな～。", "zh": "一起冒险的话，亲密度说不定也会提升哦！\n既然是合作，这种安排也很有必要吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "27dab49b86bda5e8aba65747efec69650d78e47b4081a4b4d4abee5add3cf26e", "ja": "ウン、そうだネ！\nミヤ、ワタシたちでふたりを案内してあげよっ♪", "zh": "嗯，说得对呢！\n就让我们来为他们俩带路吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "b66d97e1e25e513cf73e858d0a2c244a8f3c4d864e2db40842057f7dc3ee8633", "ja": "そうですね～。では、{$P$}さんに\nお断りしてから、行きましょう～。", "zh": "是呀～那么，先跟{$P$}先生打声招呼，再出发吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "2958db01a0b80665e1120c70e4db9c809cc4b87259cdf96485e249832103f44d", "ja": "そうだネ！　{$P$}、\nシキたちに、劇場を案内してくるヨ～？", "zh": "就是嘛！{$P$}，我去带志希她们参观一下剧场哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e31551fbdb1c8a9755cf1d7dd458ed4b8071aac54c4a0f5f04903b6457f91154", "ja": "え？　あ、うん……。\n……って、おーい、衣装のままで行くのか！？", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯……  \n……等等，喂——你们就穿着演出服去吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "fdcbdcba5a419f42755cf4a0576ed0c6aa4cbf0af5678525b3a6d2bb2f1927f1", "ja": "ここがステージですね～。\n志希さん達も、このステージに出てもらうんですよ～。", "zh": "这里就是舞台了呢～。\n志希小姐她们也要登上这个舞台哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1026_204xxx", "source_sha256": "f25fb8cff49a90cc6b58c0ed43fc08cda25142256a7e64c960225a1cc234a316", "ja": "ねえねえ、ステージに誰かいるよ？\n……おっ、あの髪は！　金髪仲間発見～♪", "zh": "喂喂，舞台上有人哦？\n……哦，那头发是！发现金发同伴啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "fe55ebee262fc67842acb76b30a73519f31f53613d7493393df6d7cf27288d8f", "ja": "こほん、あーあー……みなさまっ。\nお越しいただき、まことにありがとうございます！", "zh": "咳咳，啊——啊——……各位——\n非常感谢大家的光临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "d6b66d48cea28a3cf012167d049939a396c61a90b4520418e2c8902a559e6bc2", "ja": "あれはエミリーだネ、大和撫子を目指してるんだヨ～。\n定期公演の練習中みたい。", "zh": "那是艾米莉呢，她的目标是大和抚子哟～。\n看起来正在做定期公演的练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "ecf70924b06274ca4b6ba288ae0a9bf6047fc15203781582db72abbb38407e9e", "ja": "ふぅ……あっ、美也さん、エレナさん！\nあら？　そちらのお二方は……。", "zh": "呼……啊，美也小姐、艾蕾娜小姐！\n咦？那边两位是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1030_205xxx", "source_sha256": "a91b71b2c108b519e1133178844ccbda58671d0ab130a1dbc670424fd0299676", "ja": "初めまして。今度『Cleasky』さんと共演させて\nいただきます、一ノ瀬志希と申しますの。", "zh": "初次见面。之后将有幸与『Cleasky』合作演出，我是一之濑志希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1031_204xxx", "source_sha256": "df73099805e8ad773e616b65d6ae110cce55174854ab91540d4b596916fe7c35", "ja": "同じく、宮本フレデリカと申しますわ。\n以後、お見知りおきを……おほほ。", "zh": "我也一样，叫宫本芙蕾德莉卡哦。\n今后还请多多指教……呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "87b16ecc1afe0e826e0787024dbbf49001375156e3f3713dedc2a74bb9942e2c", "ja": "まぁ！　ご丁寧にありがとうございます♪\n初めまして、エミリー・スチュアートと申します。", "zh": "哎呀！谢谢您如此周到♪初次见面，我叫艾米莉·斯图亚特。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1033_204xxx", "source_sha256": "276a54fef31bb917de4a87b28291d36f7a0325ca73c69ea2001ca99e28ee58d8", "ja": "大和撫子、よいですわね～。\nつい撫で撫でしたくなりますわ～。", "zh": "大和抚子，真不错呢～。\n让人忍不住想摸摸头了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "f11e13748747eb8b663c7cd8977847697b86704441c892c1c7abfc4530aea6b5", "ja": "ま、まあ！　フレデリカさんも、\n大和撫子がお好きなのですか？　嬉しいです♪", "zh": "嘛、嘛呀！弗雷德莉卡小姐也喜欢大和抚子吗？我好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1035_205xxx", "source_sha256": "290842d492d9adffda5549059d198d1b99189a901597ef9bcee9a78b4e7c5d02", "ja": "と、おしとやかで油断させて……今だフレちゃん、\nこの可愛い生き物、ウチにつれて帰っちゃおう！", "zh": "装得端庄淑女一点让她放松警惕……就是现在，芙蕾德莉卡，把这个可爱的生物带回家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1036_204xxx", "source_sha256": "6260ac2f9bf8a59c02174428491fd04fc3572b8068c1cca3d8797212c605827b", "ja": "オッケー、シキちゃん！\n事務所にいいお土産ができた～！", "zh": "好嘞，志希！给事务所弄到一份不错的伴手礼啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "431d4d961d9f4b8e0ced2f1d8a2343362ed57e7c71068da8e581b60eac967e8a", "ja": "えっ、ええっ！？", "zh": "诶，诶诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "113197cdf61088391f91aa04f45a836685f68dc4aa5bc3b386414efb3a36bb59", "ja": "ストーップ！　ダメだヨ～！\nエミリーは劇場のアイドルなんだからネ！", "zh": "停——！不可以啦～！\n艾米莉可是剧场的偶像呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "5e6952ad5f6e78d4f9c7d0e8913a11ce0a1b5d471df0937e79ab5b45b064fb5d", "ja": "お土産は、エントランスのグッズ売り場で\nお願いしますね～♪", "zh": "纪念品请到入口的周边商品区购买哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "531338e090f5c4785d64e191fc5fa743a1c52f1bc86ecad1b18c0c1871920969", "ja": "くんくん……うん、いい感じにできたかも♪\nこれは律子さんで、こっちが……。", "zh": "闻闻……嗯，感觉做得很不错呢♪\n这是律子小姐，这边是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1042_205xxx", "source_sha256": "83b81989b9e93aac4524a432613fcbfd45124947266b0355ae63cfde7122407f", "ja": "あ～、いい匂いがする～……？\n志希ちゃんごのみの、複雑なフレグランス～♪", "zh": "啊～好香的味道～……？\n是志希很中意的、层次丰富的芳香～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "e3780e2b42c1f3827574afb3ed550fc353fa2452be4cbc3066b252014622cb04", "ja": "きゃっ……！\nあ、あの、どちら様……ですか？", "zh": "呀……！\n请、请问您是哪位……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1044_205xxx", "source_sha256": "15e1d24e7e171883377e839c33ac4a9183091a607d50f77de7eea55ab3f993d4", "ja": "あ、おかまいなく～、通りすがりの匂いフェチだから。\nねね、なにやってるの？", "zh": "啊，不用在意～我只是个路过的气味控。\n呐呐，你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "210812e3de6f43c7fbe8e6301f82304dd1711c4c2c1322d76f6c0edc52cbcb42", "ja": "おー、いましたよ～。志希さん、\nいきなり走っていくから、ビックリしました～。", "zh": "哦，原来在这里呀～志希小姐，\n突然就跑掉了，吓了我一跳～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1046_204xxx", "source_sha256": "fbadac5c1c8f3d17443814d9005b8130545b0cae9159a3cd83832d1de0a00820", "ja": "だよね～、シキちゃんそういうトコあるから～。", "zh": "对吧～，志希就是有这种地方嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "7dc4a7c918ac35acf79722d3c4db585e281c28f7d5b42409f786062152692b24", "ja": "カレン、このふたりは『レイジー・レイジー』の\nシキとフレデリカだヨ！　今劇場を見学してるノ！", "zh": "可怜，这两位就是『Lazy Lazy』的志希和芙蕾德莉卡哦！她们现在正在参观剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "cdc4bdba0c7899eb7204754a44d9366d2b2bae9230ecf07d4e794a94c80f35aa", "ja": "あ、こ、今度コラボするっていう？　そっか……。\n篠宮可憐、です……よ、よろしくお願いします……。", "zh": "啊，听、听说之后要合作？这样啊……。\n我、我是篠宫可怜……请、请多关照……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1049_045kar", "source_sha256": "51675f4fbc6620a0ac71c0c924de95ceb537a27cf44b4a68affdd24c886f29e1", "ja": "それで、えっと……わ、私、趣味がアロマなので、\nたまにここで、調合させてもらっていて……。", "zh": "所以，那个……我、我的爱好是香薰，偶尔会来这里调配……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1050_205xxx", "source_sha256": "ee8e95d4bed54d89fba55293780ab1198c61dc65c43e9546ceb5c46fcb47c3c0", "ja": "そうなんだ？　くんくん……うん、いいセンスしてる！\nでもあたしだったら、コレと、コレとコレ……。", "zh": "原来是这样？闻闻……嗯，很有品味嘛！不过要是我的话，就会用这个、这个，还有这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "4a5f7a8e001961b60623e27e65c5615315e4e350296118de1cb5e367394bf14c", "ja": "えっ、あっ、そ、そんなに混ぜたら……って、あれ？\nくんくん……わぁ、すっごく爽やか……！", "zh": "诶，啊，这、这么混在一起的话……咦？\n闻闻……哇，好清爽……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1052_205xxx", "source_sha256": "936a31571b825a7725ef688480c1c1931fb7464eec6c930dc2c01b35094ec913", "ja": "思い切って混ぜちゃった方が、飽きずにずっと\n楽しめるんだよねー。ほら、シュッとしてクンクン♪", "zh": "大胆地混合起来，反而能一直享受也不会腻呢——。看，喷一下，再闻闻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "e50cd5caca9a58abf0851f2a3ab18563ba90f7227d1c332a6e995b495661d630", "ja": "きゃっ……。あ……あの……。\nち、近い……です……。は、恥ずかしい……！", "zh": "呀……啊……那个……\n太、太近了……。好、好害羞……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1054_205xxx", "source_sha256": "ed5b409c6aa545f49b58bf842dbd34081dee1fbd09d006a7c4e75111db68dc36", "ja": "うふふ、いい反応！\nこれはこれは、色々試したくなっちゃうな……♪", "zh": "呵呵，反应不错嘛！\n哎呀哎呀，真想试各种各样的事情呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "15ae67e2cb8547cb443eef3a5ff4c48d58a4fc5a3472fce18da35dda9a30cfc3", "ja": "うわっ、こんなところに居た！\n道理で見つからないわけだ……ずいぶん探したよ。", "zh": "哇，原来在这儿！\n怪不得找不到……我找了好久啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1056_045kar", "source_sha256": "d062a1b177217fda94fa257ceed3db05a910dc64f54b3ccef91d79465948c547", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\nお、お疲れさまです……あ、あの、助け……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n辛、辛苦了……那、那个，救救我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1057_204xxx", "source_sha256": "c1eb9a387d2f2cfeb41dbbdc5a64328f156fa179c733d3fb569ea3378be0f221", "ja": "あれ、劇場の{$P$}？\nどしたの？　なんかあった？", "zh": "哎呀，这不是剧场的{$P$}吗？\n怎么啦？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1058_p", "source_sha256": "db4158f52f87579664623cb77cf3d770f12a0c7ff09355d1fbfe86d62b9d7910", "ja": "なんかっていうか……衣装合わせだけじゃなくて、\n今日は合同レッスンもあるから。呼びに来たんだよ。", "zh": "怎么说呢……今天不只是要试装，\n还有联合练习，所以我来叫你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1059_042miy", "source_sha256": "9b9be4910b7f1307fa1d32b16920e93630cc7b9255142113e346db02cbe92f25", "ja": "お～、そうでした～。私もついつい、\n楽しくなってしまって……すみません～。", "zh": "哦～，是这么回事～。我也不知不觉地玩得开心起来了……对不起～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1060_018ele", "source_sha256": "e73efec6ec3b4810138861a57e2207af27fd93d3a17438b29300e218f1bb85d1", "ja": "ごめんネ、{$P$}。\n劇場の紹介ができるのが、嬉しかったノ。", "zh": "对不起哦，{$P$}。能给你介绍剧场，我太开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1061_p", "source_sha256": "27c8c40c9bf9b1d8cb3ecab3a60f2314542574059babfed1e3fca2557661c43a", "ja": "いや、ふたりとも案内してくれてありがとう。\n志希、フレデリカ、そろそろいいかな？", "zh": "不，是我该谢谢你们两位带我参观剧场。\n志希、芙蕾德莉卡，差不多可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1062_205xxx", "source_sha256": "248b77fac5379ec0a3e9564ee3fbe514bbdef71f2115519cadf8d5700fbad738", "ja": "うん、志希ちゃん満足～。\nレッスンもこれくらい楽しめるかな～？", "zh": "嗯，志希我很满足哦～。\n训练也能这么开心吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1064_204xxx", "source_sha256": "69de605da89dc57fdee3fb0c474bf8d5ee7cca02db1074fc5fe58e2ba7b3748b", "ja": "ん、ウチのプロデューサー、もう着くって。\nシキちゃん、早く着替えちゃおー。", "zh": "嗯，我们家制作人说马上就要到了。\n志希，快点换衣服吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1065_205xxx", "source_sha256": "fbb3354b7f50a0c2339c7a4a6984adda9e0482cf329e1fdc356c9bf624e0a3e7", "ja": "おっけー、志希ちゃん早着替えの術～。\nただ脱ぐだけとも言う～。", "zh": "好嘞，志希的快速换装之术～  \n也可以说，就是脱衣服而已～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1066_204xxx", "source_sha256": "6d78840c32c5e1b0d7f2e5fa188a5976fa745af201a29a1195c3ad86431734d0", "ja": "いやー、楽しいね、この劇場！\nおもちゃ箱みたいで。いろんな子がいて。", "zh": "哎呀～，好开心啊，这个剧场！\n就像玩具箱一样。有各种各样的孩子在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1067_204xxx", "source_sha256": "254cd97b61c64646644d13eb23ec1280a570834efe7d67a9204b164fc63d2d44", "ja": "今度はミヤちゃんとエレナちゃんをウチに\n招待して冒険したいな。楽しいし、いい子達だし♪", "zh": "下次真想邀请美也和艾蕾娜来我家冒险呢。既有趣，她们又都是好孩子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1068_205xxx", "source_sha256": "e0c2c8ea430dfe8515bd724b71a5dfd03337078abba715ee913b2af7c19c77d7", "ja": "そうだね～、でも……ふふ。", "zh": "是呀～不过……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_02_1069_205xxx", "source_sha256": "808082053cf858b0223c47d86e18d9328d800a8edf1bc134923b613851bd5100", "ja": "いい子なだけじゃ、つまんないよね？", "zh": "光是当个乖孩子，也很无聊吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
